	quest.21C5DF48DDE196A5.quest_desc: [
		"&4&oSupporting a modpack on CurseForge helps creators continue delivering high-quality content for the Minecraft community. By endorsing a modpack, you encourage the development of unique gameplay experiences, creative builds, and innovative features that enhance the game. "
		""
		"&4&o无论是留下好评、与朋友分享整合包，还是通过捐赠或订阅支持创作者，你的参与都激励着他们的热情，让项目得以延续。&r&r"
		""
		"&4&oCurseForge 为模组作者和玩家提供了一个便捷的交流平台，你的支持对于塑造和维持模组生态系统至关重要。&r&r&r&r"
	]
